<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTALK JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTALK JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.03 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.72 vs   0.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.65 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Sales		   20.35 vs  16.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.43 vs   1.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.34 vs   3.12</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.17 vs   1.41</p>
<p> Sales		   78.64 vs  67.24</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Krakow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
